 ## CLI Reference
 
+The isolated Polish Pi M0 harness can explicitly bind a fresh artifact session to a shared delivery ledger. For those sessions only, poll output includes a `delivery` identity, and writing the response does not confirm agent consumption. The harness handles exact host receipts and final-batch ending; unassociated legacy reply/end/reopen operations are refused. There is no public CLI flag enabling this experimental mode. Ordinary Lavish sessions retain the commands below.
+
 | Command                         | Description                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
 | ------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
 | `lavish-axi`                    | Show current sessions and usage guidance.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
